Make esp_video 2.4.x DVP deinitialization retry-safe.

Reserve the DVP video object before deleting SCCB, the sensor, or the common
video object. The global/object lock order closes the open-vs-destroy race, and
the staged teardown makes every completed cleanup step idempotent on a later
Board Manager retry.

